sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 사용자
    participant App as pwa.js
    participant VJ as version.json
    participant SW as service-worker.js
    participant Boot as appBootstrap.js

    User->>App: 페이지 로드
    App->>App: registerServiceWorker()
    App->>VJ: fetch version.json (no-cache)
    VJ-->>App: { appVersion, swVersion }

    alt appVersion !== localStorage 저장값
        App->>SW: postMessage SKIP_WAITING
        SW->>SW: skipWaiting + clients.claim
        App->>App: sessionStorage 플래그 + reload
    end

    App->>Boot: ensureLatestVersion() resolve
    Boot->>Boot: bootApp() (Firebase init)

    Note over SW: fetch 이벤트: cache no-store pass-through<br/>오프라인 asset 캐시 없음

    alt 새 SW activate (배포 후)
        SW->>SW: caches.keys() → 전부 delete
        SW->>User: controllerchange → reload
    end
